<SiteLayout current="results" title="Results & Evaluation — Kimi K3 from Scratch" description="Training status and evaluation plan for the 300M-parameter Kimi K3 from Scratch project.">
  <section class="page-intro"><div class="page-kicker">04 / RESULTS & EVALUATION</div><h1>Evidence, <em>not promises.</em></h1><p>The 6B-token pretraining horizon was initiated after an 80M-token pilot passed the learning, stability, and recovery gates. Final model-quality results will be published after evaluation.</p></section>
  <section class="content-section"><div class="section-rail"><span class="section-index">01 / CURRENT STATUS</span><span class="rail-line"></span></div><div class="section-main"><div class="section-topline">REPORTED WITH CARE</div><h2>Final evaluation <em>pending.</em></h2><div class="results-panel"><span class="results-emblem" aria-hidden="true">◇</span><div><strong>No final scores published yet.</strong><p>This page intentionally avoids preliminary benchmark claims or sample outputs presented as final evidence. Once training and evaluation finish, it will contain the final checkpoint identity, evaluation protocol, model-quality measurements, training curves, and failure analysis.</p></div></div><p class="notice">Project status is editorial rather than a live connection to the training GPU.</p></div></section>
  <section class="content-section"><div class="section-rail"><span class="section-index">02 / THE PILOT</span><span class="rail-line"></span></div><div class="section-main"><div class="section-topline">COMPLETED BEFORE THE FINAL RUN</div><h2>Learning before <em>scaling.</em></h2><p class="section-lead">The 80M-token pilot provided evidence that the system was learning and numerically stable enough to continue the run.</p><div class="process-grid"><div class="process-card"><span>80,019,456 TOKENS</span><h3>Learning signal</h3><p>Validation loss declined from 7.8979 to 4.1003 across twenty recorded evaluations of the same validation prefix.</p></div><div class="process-card"><span>OPERATIONAL GATE</span><h3>Recovery proved</h3><p>Checkpoint continuation was tested before the full-run authorization, preserving optimizer, data, RNG and schedule state.</p></div></div><p class="notice">The pilot results do not establish final generalization quality. Repeated evaluation on one validation prefix has limited statistical coverage.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/adriaflores/kimi-k3-from-scratch/blob/main/experiments/m7/m75_gate/docs/M7_4_scientific_decision.md">Read the pilot scientific decision ↗</a></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
